      "title": "No-match share (1 h)",
      "description": "Recognised help-center questions (and searchHelpCenter calls) the knowledge base had nothing for: candidates for new articles. Messages the rules did not recognise (source unrecognised) are left out: nothing found is their normal outcome.",
